<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Weekly S.African JSE value traded at record high.</title>
<headline>Weekly S.African JSE value traded at record high.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's Johannesburg Stock Exchange (JSE) said on Friday value traded hit an all time weekly high of 5.844 billion rand in the week ended June 20.</p>
<p>The bourse said the previous high was recorded in the week ended April 25, when 4.750 billion rand worth of shares exchanged hands.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
